{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1566,
  "batch_count": 1700,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "dee43784390e4551565b4149c73094c85eded86d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128c2ab7f5da8989c681ec25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，也就这种程度吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36af851c319bc2e198e2be7c81435e21e337db71a388f1a61399aa6f5b78020c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbdcd244d8bf5d653e191d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这种程度只是基本素养罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36ec8bfa65af8a7cb72bb5db0e0aced63d9064f448cb91dcd48afb7c0ec1362",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3210be067235b1f9e71e2f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，去赢下比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1577dd77e575ab25a3d8e70ad9a0d219fb75f8c7467372878632d31d35e2e48f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060bb5fa353c82dcf4fb3deb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为与你一起，才能看见。\r\n称霸三种距离的光景……呵呵。真期待\r\n总有一天会迎来的“那一天”呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f27abdb11339a7cc0c891458932df14230b1f189a8b6ddd805905e058aa86ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0a27329246b76634879334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a69a14975a35064c57f7fefe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c664d4d7343da10b916da4eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不安和不满也一定要告诉彼此！这也是\r\n英里规则！所以我要说……\r\n信任度100英里☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba24dc5f648c44b0c5cbf0dc595312dc1d8a51afdb75675991b6a37ded50bd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36b8a28fc96b0239031c5f20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿♪我刚刚看见了，你\r\n正在积攒英里！\r\n……我们一起，去南方的岛屿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e19d4f7d6cb962d63f79f3d88eb745d6aa84b734bcf349ad53a72db6267dc513",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a70440e8f461897159ffb55a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n……好，英里规则完成！我早就决定\r\n第一个祝福的人要是训练员了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab763cedbdbeaf12cac5ce085aa1cce721f73dd67b38cc33eb6096c9499b724",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9385f53c84d38dcb4ddd7d4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好啦～！一颗就能补充跑0.1英里\r\n所需热量的\r\n巧克力！待会儿分给你一些！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e66cc8cc429c015cd6c194378ae88af49fe584a95a47d245beeb83162b673a96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d6d104dbf59cf80064ae2f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力亲手做巧克力的！\r\n因为……嘿嘿☆想融入的心意，\r\n足足有无限英里呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "573237cda3cc4e4e6f39735bb10c1528d13b9eb5d2fd1307f19d1741c1efa7ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dccdcb28645bbcf936ac08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在许愿笺上写报告而不是愿望\r\n就是我的英里规则！嗯，今年该报告哪件\r\n“已经完成的事”呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7008a959dc8d703c0f7129fd4d99c15594fbed05dcf9e2e2e7e4cf19debc28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09781490e45cfcd3f4467dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一时得意，吃了好多\r\n零食！要跑多少英里\r\n才能消耗掉这些能量呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8b57b9a0f8eb46393a85a9d6964ecd1923cd006901648a6ebce23235135a9f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:652ce7e2c549f25bd0069187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节的时候，妈妈总会把工作，\r\n提前结束！\r\n呵呵……全家一起吃晚饭，真期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "201c17b4d32c51519c566fcce90a52fccfd16621817709f074ff11c9acb1bec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a94a5567da636b8377f0362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来有时间吗？\r\n可以的话，希望你腾出时间☆\r\n灯饰，我想和你一起看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91e893efe829be8e7f1be80705818757fe4ed7043c856551eb14fefe4b0b806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d48b3c81e269329723f1cbcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜悦100英里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0311fb222f095c131a3bbf2eadc1881482d2d03551ff4f72cc199fe3f40a91a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:121fbd763c8dd50b8659da76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年跑了多少英里呢……\r\n明年我要跑上10倍英里，\r\n所以请看着我吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "684584ca793e4e7f9ae3da8884799e6a91ec21982320b4c2bd3f118955b96a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4c5369502c3af0e55ac3e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日一转眼就结束了呢。\r\n感觉比英里赛还快……\r\n不如明天也继续庆祝？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af13cfb7358cef72ed91296045549afa3e78b50e40f361ce1e12ab4a26603ed1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d47cc57d11cd52032a0049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，去生日派对的会场！\r\n我要让你深刻体会……我\r\n究竟有多少英里想为你庆祝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ece40c80f25c29dc3422c50a4e450450b4acaf97f68497bf20eeb1569bdeb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324e26ef57f86b1c53c0e854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日时，大家带我去玩了\r\n障碍挑战！有适当的\r\n难度，真好玩～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bffc46fcb4e0cf3adbe135481e114f21120f7b82876e3705deb1bcf29c9f66f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e28b15db6f5fbc8f16020b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇！你要为我庆祝生日吗？\r\n……嘿嘿，怎么办！高兴得\r\n连英里也形容不出来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "998259dd36604e19b63d21aa144b6b018d56fa6d59857791766d552ac11b6f40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63aa395406eeee77f373f80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，有通知哦！\r\n不好奇吗？\r\n大概10英里☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "288f87ecb03d16505df5eef1442996428f3418ac9443d80a9266a7454d2f91c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a795ac2332298b467cc58be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，是礼物！\r\n说不定拿到了英里积分！\r\n嘿嘿～，快打开看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78e70b49ac5e021021030d85387a50df032bbe965ef1106c82ce6c9a601caa47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a3991cf2334b51301bda1bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵锵☆\r\n任务完成了！\r\n不愧是，我的训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8247f62bd61186deb234f788d47ed3a1597e00f0997e717ecb08306c9464979",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f2909681d9505ba1ce7fb6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要举办活动！\r\n好，不管什么都尽管来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2e518a7112e31ba3199dcc44e3958892cef489aeb2318b511abb032da17e9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3244f203ee7673047107aecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动，好像已经开始\r\n了哦！光看着不会有任何\r\n收获，先参加再说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c406a236bb2ebc56046f3e8cf25c668b7b3642b24b802a3fab2bb5ee5a7944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e39b870593e92d9d341492cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次不会输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce45e4f286ed694431c73a6bab6421bb6d18586fd7e3368a9ce4476935378ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c122cd18e15cc2aa1ffa39e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升！\r\n训练员也在贯彻\r\n最强呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fad10ea003eeb9cef69d7cf2201f77d858cca88da04e81aeb63c13901e2a4585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8e21916ed4a5f464aeef230",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看，胸前的标志！\r\n没错，是英里☆\r\n为了找到它可费了不少劲～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f4e59b5947e754c8e7c6b5814c7442520ca4a75542b1ac39b4f122f5dbac51c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66ccf45fd9fb0bba81515cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我从小就很擅长，保持衣服干净！\r\n就算玩躲避球之类的，\r\n也从没被击中过就赢了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9788b82cc78de9c7764b6113a79fcaac517b32da287ae521d38426c0d74bcdea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edda7c77d357e0926548daf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "购物时重要的是能不能\r\n积攒里程！所以，事先\r\n收集信息可是必不可少的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db19d10cef1708aa7918e34fabaa41368f63a91dbdba0310f67e03356fc9678a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e282dbd96746783226f83589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都很强呢，双方都是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ceb0267e6c3cf965934792613d56310239a72bd340a4ab1c5e7fdbae0e781aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335c2ae6eb3a543d3de1153c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的话当然没问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41784326f179518ea7946135e3736d6030badd2fe55211b82379ffe2373d51db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4117e3ff5a63ef1466f67ada",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次不会输！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce45e4f286ed694431c73a6bab6421bb6d18586fd7e3368a9ce4476935378ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e43c50ea072aa6f384efd5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都很强呢，双方都是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ceb0267e6c3cf965934792613d56310239a72bd340a4ab1c5e7fdbae0e781aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a727ea0b5dbc4216a2e5a85b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最高分刷新了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdae7b5ca08e6c7d41717b36a9596cc04a66477b8ba95d9051512940b2fe5846",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d18b629d374e1916ba6b7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是，全英里制霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc128abde14a89511d73a5feb7310e0c8b9e296c8b85a55ae4e2fbec4817ecae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f98c84cef82baa1759ef43bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5c6c12259cf664ac4b9a5b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽情练起来吧！\r\n不管什么，我都会完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c72c5a9f74e3ef5f3c0c6adb3a6b6cfc2dcc9cc70416f227755fca7c94fd4e35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bd229893db3c7959ce7da45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的历史啊……我也，\r\n会在这里留下名字！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3db6f22dd94b0fc36e6e594c5fa9b2785f441aa3b0b4a467364ad05aec7338f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e44ed213c5aab16dc7fd246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！英里赛\r\n正在等着我们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95bc9ac6ef8658ba6189b5b1389c1985d19a3f89cf67615752726c5926aaadc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f82418a23b49ad6c37b412db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘，Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb83cf4ef414ba1498ca22eb71c89743df595040a09f9d503fb2e9db9beca0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc1335789fbd8b8f8e0d372",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许能变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a75928eb807ba5ab10fa65cf93606fa07784ae1022f355f9f2c471465a8abc00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99c373f134579d11b71b1228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "英里规则是～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b10676b263ec30d1464736b879f84c8f13eccec54b12bc319b3e66874d6c8ae2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1227"
      ]
    },
    {
